      "questionText": "<p><strong>Read the conversation and then choose the correct answer to fill in each blank.</strong></p>\n<p>Emily: Hi, John. Did you hear about the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='0' name='fbo-900989-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-900989-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-900989-0'></option><option value=\"tidal\" data-testid='fillblank-option-900989-0-tidal'>tidal</option><option value=\"tropical\" data-testid='fillblank-option-900989-0-tropical'>tropical</option></select></span></strong> storm on the news?</p>\n<p>John: Yes, they said it might cause strong <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='1' name='fbo-900989-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-900989-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-900989-1'></option><option value=\"winds\" data-testid='fillblank-option-900989-1-winds'>winds</option><option value=\"snows\" data-testid='fillblank-option-900989-1-snows'>snows</option></select></span></strong> tomorrow.</p>\n<p>Emily: That&#8217;s scary. And it often brings too much rain, which turns the ground into <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='2' name='fbo-900989-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-900989-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-900989-2'></option><option value=\"mud\" data-testid='fillblank-option-900989-2-mud'>mud</option><option value=\"soil\" data-testid='fillblank-option-900989-2-soil'>soil</option></select></span></strong>.</p>\n<p>John: You&#8217;re right. It&#8217;s hard to move when everything is wet and slippery.</p>\n<p>Emily: I hope the warning <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='3' name='fbo-900989-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-900989-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-90