      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Complete the text, using the words given.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Natural disasters can happen in different types of weather. In <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><input id='fbo-901000-0' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-901000-0' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901000-0' /></span></strong> areas, storms often bring heavy rain and strong winds. These storms can <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><input id='fbo-901000-1' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-901000-1' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901000-1' /></span></strong> floods, which damage&nbsp;homes and roads. In colder places, a<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><input id='fbo-901000-2' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-901000-2' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901000-2' /></span></strong> winter can lead to problems like blocked roads and frozen pipes. People need to stay warm and safe when the temperature drops below zero on the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.4</label><input id='fbo-901000-3' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='3' name='fbo-901000-3' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901000-3' /></span></strong> scale. Sometimes, disasters like earthquakes or hurricanes can completely <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.5</label><input id='fbo-901000-4' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='4' name='fbo-901000-4' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901000-4' /></span></strong> buildings and leave people without homes. It is important to prepare for natural disasters by having food, water, and a plan. Staying informed about the weather and listening to warnings can also help keep everyone safe. Natural disasters are dangerous, but being ready can reduce their impact.</p>",
