      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"word\"><strong>Read the text and then choose the correct answer to fill in each blank.</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Discover the City&#8217;s Natural Disaster Safety Program!</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Are you worried about staying safe during natural disasters? Our program is perfect for you!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>What To Offer</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li>\n<p><strong>Outdoor Activities</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Learn how to stay safe when a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-901168-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-901168-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901168-0'></option><option value=\"sunrise\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-0-sunrise'>sunrise</option><option value=\"tornado\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-0-tornado'>tornado</option><option value=\"wind\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-0-wind'>wind</option><option value=\"rain\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-0-rain'>rain</option></select></span></strong> comes as it often happens in our city.</li>\n<li>Learn how to prepare and protect your home during a(n) <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-901168-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-901168-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901168-1'></option><option value=\"drought\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-1-drought'>drought</option><option value=\"earthquake\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-1-earthquake'>earthquake</option><option value=\"wildfire\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-1-wildfire'>wildfire</option><option value=\"flood\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-1-flood'>flood</option></select></span></strong> that a storm can cause.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Indoor Sessions</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Build a disaster safety <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-901168-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-901168-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901168-2'></option><option value=\"fair\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-2-fair'>fair</option><option value=\"system\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-2-system'>system</option><option value=\"list\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-2-list'>list</option><option value=\"schedule\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-2-schedule'>schedule</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;for your home.</li>\n<li>Know tips to reduce <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-901168-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-901168-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901168-3'></option><option value=\"damage\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-3-damage'>damage</option><option value=\"benefit\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-3-benefit'>benefit</option><option value=\"advantage\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-3-advantage'>advantage</option><option value=\"energy\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901168-3-energy'>energy</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;from natural disasters.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why Join Us?</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li><strong>Stay Prepared:</strong> Learn practical skills for emergencies.</li>\n<li><strong>Feel Safe:</strong> Gain the knowledge to protect your family.</li>\n<li><strong>Build Awareness:</strong> Understand the effects of natural disasters and how to respond effectively.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How to Join?</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Visit our center at City Hall to sign up.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Contact us at <a href=\"mailto:safetyprogram@citycouncil.gov\">safetyprogram@citycouncil.gov</a>&nbsp;for more details.</li>\n</ul>",
